  "pieces": "id = the lines.js thing id (or a name the game uses); role: static (merged) | prop (batched, can wobble) | keep (its own mesh: it has nodes that move); collide: mesh (default) | none",
  "things": "every touchable / secret spot: id (lines.js things[] / secrets[] / cats[]), kind thing|secret|cat|door, position (where to stand or the thing's centre), radius (touch range), piece (index into pieces), node (glb child node or anchor that moves or marks the spot)",
  "lights": "three.js PointLight(colour, intensity, distance, decay 2) as src/layout.js reads it (halo, flicker, pool). priority 1 = a real light; priority 2 = halo + pool only (intensity 0, the value is in intensity_full)",
