  "fx": "particles the engine draws: steam (rising wisps), moths (circle a lamp), fireflies (drift in a box), drips",
  "routes": "safe climbs: waypoints are surfaces Ghost stands on in order (top = surface height); every step up <= 0.85 m and every gap <= 2.0 m"
